WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Now see if you can hear the difference between dental and retroflex consonants.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
You will hear pairs of words. The first with a dental consonant in the middle, the second with a retroflex.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.500
After a short pause, one of the two will be repeated. Say which it is.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
❓

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.500
❓

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.500
That was the first one, dental. [பத்து (pattu) ✅, பட்டு (paṭṭu) ❌]

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.000
❓

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.500
❓

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
That was the second one, retroflex. [ஆத்த (aatta) ❌, ஆட்ட (aaṭṭa) ✅]

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.000
❓

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.500
❓

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.000
That was the second one, retroflex. [இது (idu) ❌, இடு (iḍu) ✅]

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.500
❓

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.000
❓

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.500
That was the first one, dental. [பந்து (pandu) ✅, பண்டு (paṇḍu) ❌]